WEBVTT

00:00:00.978 --> 00:00:03.526
A year went by without a rescue ship.

00:00:03.526 --> 00:00:05.801
They made an anvil of iron ballast.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.762
They would build a vessel themselves.

00:00:10.114 --> 00:00:12.435
Raynal made a saw and chisels.

00:00:12.435 --> 00:00:15.960
The keel was ready,
but its bolts needed deep holes.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.559
All the steel he had came
from their mining tools.

